    "title": "Just Another Pain in the Neck - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago For some reason, the other week I thought of my maternal grandfather, after whom I was named. He had a farm up in the hills of Pennsylvania, and when I would visit, my cousins and I would get together and make fun of old grandpa. I didn’t understand at the time, but I’m beginning to understand now. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
